# INVWINHB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, run with /CFG:NODIR/INV.CFG, a
# settings file in a directory that does not exist, which reads as every
# default: a station typed into the settings cannot be saved, a message
# box giving the DOS error, and the dialog shows again with the station
# as typed; Cancel then leaves it.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINHB.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-O S TAB
T LAB
K ENTER
S REFUSED
K ENTER
S KEPT
K ESC
S LEFT
K ALT-F X
